      "parameters": {
        "content": "✂️ **TEXT SPLITTER**\n\nBreaks documents into chunks:\n- Recursive character splitting\n- Manageable piece sizes\n- Preserves context\n- Optimizes for embeddings\n\nFeeds into Document Loader",
