    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🧠 **RAG AGENT - The Brain**\n\nThis is the core AI that:\n- Processes user questions\n- Decides when to search documents\n- Combines knowledge with reasoning\n- Maintains conversation flow",
        "height": 184,
