    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🤖 **LANGUAGE MODEL**\n\nGPT-4o-mini provides:\n- Natural language understanding\n- Response generation\n- Reasoning capabilities\n- Cost-effective AI power",
        "width": 220,
