    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🎯 **LISTEN WEB-HOOK TRIGGER**\nThis is your main entry point!\n- Receives audio files via POST webhook\n- Extracts session ID from x-session-id headers\n- Passes audio to transcription pipeline\n- Webhook-based for real-time voice interactions",
        "height": 196,
        "width": 328,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [144, -608],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b7388ba2-bb7a-4438-bc49-6a67437edd6a",
      "name": "Trigger Explanation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Book Companion -> Voice Agent RAG <- with Memory\n\n🎙️ **VOICE-TO-VOICE INTERFACE**\n- User sends audio → Transcription → RAG Agent → Audio response\n- Processes voice input via OpenAI Whisper transcription\n- Returns spoken answers using OpenAI text-to-speech (Fable voice)\n- Session-based conversations via x-session-id headers\n\n🤖 **RAG AGENT CORE**\n- OpenAI GPT-4o-mini processes transcribed questions\n- Retrieves content ONLY from \"Building LLM from Scratch\" book\n- Enforces strict book-only responses with graceful handling\n- Brief, direct answers (max 1-2 sentences)\n\n🧠 **Memory System:**\n- Postgres stores chat history with 20-message context window\n- Session-based memory using custom session keys\n- Enables natural, flowing voice conversations\n\n🔍 **Knowledge Retrieval:**\n- Supabase vector store with OpenAI text-embedding-3-large\n- Searches top 3 relevant book chunks per query\n- Tool-based retrieval specifically for building LLM content\n- Grounded responses - says \"Not in book\" when uncertain",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 1120,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-368, -736],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "d9d7d95f-dfa8-4f9d-8cc1-86af61b5c0fe",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🎤 **AUDIO TRANSCRIPTION**\nConverts voice to text!\n- Uses OpenAI Whisper to transcribe audio input\n- Processes binary audio data from webhook\n- Outputs clean text for RAG Agent processing",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 272,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [560, -640],
